"..Under those circumstances, the District Collector, Hyderabad District is directed to depute an Officer, not below the rank of Revenue Divisional Officer, to conduct spot inspection of the subject land within 15 days from the date of receipt of this order;
1) To identify the surplus land and the retainable land of the petitioner and draw a sketch/map.
2) What was the area of the surplus land allotted to others.
